{"skill":{"slug":"shadcn-ui","displayName":"Shadcn Ui"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770008226029,"changelog":"shadcn-ui 1.0.0 – Initial Release\n\n- Provides expert guidance for building UIs with shadcn/ui, Tailwind CSS, react-hook-form, and zod.\n- Covers installation steps, component categories, and usage best practices.\n- Includes detailed component tables for layout, navigation, data display, forms, actions, and feedback.\n- Offers a complete react-hook-form + zod form pattern example using shadcn/ui components.\n- Supports theming, dark mode, sidebar layouts, and mobile navigation use cases.\n- Triggered by keywords like shadcn, radix, UI components, form pattern, and theming.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":17650,"sha256":"ec4cee3a75b7780d837a572d8986098ddcad0f94423b2b1e56a636637a68e603","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1864,"sha256":"cacb7b20f2bfa32085a1cafbd651dd6d6984133873544576c67a91d1b2b0a411","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789027853646,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"209c994d10d2bbfe821b302415762ba557299c70b19b896a40c34c16f0154566","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/209c994d10d2bbfe821b302415762ba557299c70b19b896a40c34c16f0154566","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: shadcn-ui\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is a comprehensive guide for using shadcn/ui, Tailwind CSS, react-hook-form, and zod. The `SKILL.md` primarily contains documentation and code examples for UI development. The `npx shadcn@latest` commands are standard for installing and adding shadcn/ui components, which is a legitimate and widely used library. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, obfuscation, or prompt injection attempts against the agent beyond the stated purpose 